<
Size=1280x720
title=AVG 绘图演示
Font="Microsoft YaHei"
>
<
Start:
S.character("小菲")
S.cg("bg/room.png")

"现在画面正中间是 (x:0, y:0)。往右 x 变大，往上 y 变大喵。"

SET 三角形:
    go(120px)
    left(120)
    go(120px)
    left(120)
    go(120px)

SET 小房子:
    color("#ff88bb")
    go(100px)
    left(90)
    go(100px)
    left(90)
    go(100px)
    left(90)
    go(100px)
    color("#7fb3ff")
    left(90)
    go(100px)
    right(135)
    go(70px)
    right(90)
    go(70px)

"先画内置形状：一个方框在正中，一个圆圈在右上。"
S.AVG-button(x:0,y:0,"box")
S.AVG-button(x:180,y:150,"circle", color="#ffc44d", size=110, width=5)

"再用 SET 定义的画：三角形在左下，小房子在右边。"
S.AVG-button(-260,-180,"三角形", color="#6fd6a8")
S.AVG-button(250,-100,"小房子")

"坐标也能用变量：SET x = -100，然后 x:x*2 就是 -200。"
SET x = -100
S.AVG-button(x:x*2, y:-250, "circle", color="#ff5577", size=60)

"画满了？S.AVG-clear() 一次擦干净。"
S.AVG-clear()

"擦掉了。AVG 系统还能当进度条、指北针、小游戏棋盘……随你发挥喵！"
S.AVG-button(0,-200,"三角形", color="#c79bff", width=6)

"感谢游玩"
>
